{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34178","headline":"杂讽九首 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"𪃿鹅惨於冰，陆立怀所适\n斯人道仍閟，不得不呜呃。\n当时布衣士，亦作天子客。\n至今东方生，满口自夸白。\n终爲万乘交，谈笑无所隔。\n致君非有书，乃是尧舜画。\n祗今侯门峻，日扫贫贱迹。\n朝趋九韶音，暮列五鼎食。\n如闻恭俭语，謇謇事夕惕。\n可拍伊牧肩，功名被金石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}